stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Planned: 模型提出调用
    Planned --> Checking: 检查策略与权限
    Checking --> Rejected: 硬拒绝或直接阻止
    Checking --> Paused: 需要人工决定
    Checking --> Executing: 无需审核
    Paused --> CheckingAgain: 用户批准并恢复
    Paused --> Rejected: 用户拒绝
    CheckingAgain --> Paused: 下一层再次需要审核
    CheckingAgain --> Rejected: 后续检查失败
    CheckingAgain --> Executing: 检查通过
    Executing --> Finished: 返回工具结果
    Rejected --> Finished: 返回拒绝结果
    Finished --> [*]
